{
  "id": 2093,
  "name": "sunrise-flower-pick",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "朝焼け空を　イメージさせる　お花のピック。空花シリーズの　ピックを　何種類か　使うとピクニック気分が　盛り上がること　うけあい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "아침노을을 연상시키는 꽃 모양 픽. 하늘꽃 시리즈 픽을 여러 종류 사용하면 틀림없이 피크닉이 더욱더 즐거워질 것이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以朝霞為意象的花朵小籤。將天色花朵系列的三明治籤搭配使用，肯定能增添野餐的興致。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique ornée d’une fleur évoquant l’aurore. Il en existe toute une série. Les utiliser ensemble dans un pique-nique permet de donner une ambiance festive.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Blumen-Pikser, der an die Morgensonne denken lässt, und zu einer Serie von Tageszeit-Piksern gehört. Nutzt man mehrere, ist eine tolle Picknickstimmung garantiert!",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El color de la flor recuerda al amanecer. Los palillos con forma de flor resultan muy vistosos combinados entre sí y ayudan a crear un ambiente animado en los pícnics.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino a forma di fiore che evoca il cielo all’alba. Usando diversi tipi di questi stecchini si può star sicuri di creare una fantastica atmosfera da picnic.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flower pick designed to evoke a glorious sunrise. It’s part of a line of “sky-flower” picks. Using a few is guaranteed to boost that special picnic spirit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "朝焼け空を　イメージさせる　お花のピック。空花シリーズの　ピックを　何種類か　使うとピクニック気分が　盛り上がること　うけあい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以朝霞为灵感创作的花朵签子。只要用上几种天色花朵系列的签子，保证能让野餐的氛围得到升华。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El color de la flor recuerda al amanecer. Los palillos con forma de flor resultan muy vistosos combinados entre sí y ayudan a crear un ambiente animado en los pícnics.",
